From 9e13d4d7d682ac2f36bf7a044154aa9efb00b599 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:53:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): Machines pane kind dropdown filters the list, with
 an All entry

The dropdown starts on All (every machine, New blank disabled with a
tooltip). Picking a kind filters the list to that kind and enables and
accent-fills New blank. Machines with no stated kind show only under All.
View state only; nothing is written to the document.

Fixes #816

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
